# Images Folder

Place your images here following this structure:

## Required Images:

### Hero Section (26 de enero):
- `hero-image.jpg` - Main image representing Momentum/Prepa Tec

### Autobiography Section (29 de enero):
- `childhood-1.jpg` - Photo from early childhood
- `childhood-2.jpg` - Photo from primary school
- `childhood-3.jpg` - Photo from secondary school

### Top 10 Moments (29 de enero - 3 de febrero):
- `moment-1.jpg` through `moment-10.jpg` - Your top 10 moments at Prepa Tec

## Image Guidelines:
- Use JPG or PNG format
- Recommended resolution: 1920x1080 or higher
- Keep file sizes reasonable (under 2MB per image)
- Use descriptive filenames if you want to rename them
- Ensure photos follow school regulations (no alcohol, vapes, etc.)

## Tips:
- Use high-quality images for better visual impact
- Consider the aspect ratios for better layout display
- Compress images if they're too large to improve loading times
